   "Node list = groups concatenated in order.",
   "p_j names a node and its group forms a Pruefer sequence.",
   "Decoding: repeatedly take the smallest group not yet removed and no longer present in the rest of the sequence, emit [groups[leaf][e_leaf], node p_j], remove it.",
